Bit16: Charge-Enable Relay Fault
Bit17: Internal Cell Communication Fault
Bit18: Cell Balancing Stuck Off Fault
Bit19: Weak Cell Fault
Bit20: Low Cell Voltage Fault
Bit21: Cell Open Wiring Fault
